# Minecraft Version(s): 26.1.x
## Changes:
- Lang Files are now getting automatically synced with crowdin with new releases
- Added a new Journal Book series describing the daily life of normal citizens
- Added option to pause menu options to allow players to change how they trigger their race ability (Crouch, Sprint, Jump, Disabled)
- Added option to pause menu options for players to get an info chat message about their current race & class
- Doubled the amount of death messages per race

## Fixes:
- pale_bloom configured feature having the wrong file name (ashen_bloom) resulting in Pale Bloom Scrolls not working
- Miner class getting Hermit Starter Equipment